WHAT IS STILL UNSEEN
The panel's orientation and colours, and the LED strip's colours - neither can be read over USB. Both
are one switch in badge_pins.h (PANEL_SWAP_XY / PANEL_MIRROR_X / PANEL_BGR) if they come up wrong.
